<h1 id="kitchen-sink">Kitchen sink<a href="#kitchen-sink" class="anchor" rel="noopener noreferrer"></a></h1>
<p>A paragraph of ordinary prose, long enough to wrap over several lines so that the measure, the line height and the rhythm between blocks can be judged. It has <strong>bold</strong>, <em>italic</em>, <del>strikethrough</del>, <code>inline code</code>, a <a href="https://example.com" rel="noopener noreferrer">link</a>, <kbd>⌘</kbd> <kbd>F</kbd>, and a footnote.<sup class="footnote-ref"><a href="#fn-1" id="fnref-1" rel="noopener noreferrer">1</a></sup></p>
<p>A very long URL that must wrap instead of widening the page: <a href="https://example.com/a/very/long/path/that/keeps/going/and/going/without/any/space/to/break/on/at/all/index.html" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://example.com/a/very/long/path/that/keeps/going/and/going/without/any/space/to/break/on/at/all/index.html</a></p>
