<ul>
<li>First item</li>
<li>Second item with a longer text that wraps onto a second line when the window is narrow enough
<ul>
<li>Nested item
<ul>
<li>Deeper item</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>Third item</li>
</ul>
<ol>
<li>Step one</li>
<li>Step two
<ol>
